# practice with Pupil (level 10 warrior, intelligence 18, four sessions) by the warriors' guildmaster (3023), and with
# Decimus in the temple, where no one teaches. A session adds 40 over the skill's rating: dagger (rating 2) goes from
# 50 to 70, then to the warriors' adept of 75; axe (rating 4) from 1 to 11.
@connect pupil
Pupil
psswrd
@return
practice
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
practice
practice dagger
@as pupil
sleep
practice dagger
wake
# What can't be practised: no such skill, one Pupil doesn't know (kick), one above Pupil's level (third attack, 12).
practice foo
practice kick
practice third attack
practice dagger
practice dagger
practice dagger
# find_spell takes the first skill a prefix names that Pupil can use: "d" passes spells starting with d to reach
# dagger, "ax" is the axe.
practice d
practice ax
# practice takes its whole argument as the name, quotes and all, so this one names nothing.
practice 'second attack'
practice recall
practice axe
practice
@state
